          "Combination massage , also referred to as integrated or customized massage, is a therapeutic approach that blends various massage techniques into a single session. This integration can include elements from Swedish massage, deep tissue massage, aromatherapy, reflexology, hot stone massage, and more. The primary aim of combination massage is to tailor the treatment to the specific needs of the individual, ensuring a highly personalized and effective therapy."
