          "This session was transformative. The therapist alternated between gentle, soothing strokes and firm pressure to target my sore muscles. I felt the relaxation wash over me as the stress melted away, but at the same time, I knew that the therapist was addressing the deeper issues in my muscles. Afterward, I felt both mentally relaxed and physically refreshed — the perfect balance of both worlds."
